        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Early Naturalists - Aristotle, Linnaeus, Buffon, John Ray",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "PROBLEM:\n  ~10 million species on Earth (estimated).\n  Without a classification system: impossible to communicate, compare, accumulate.\n  Name an animal in your language → someone in another language doesn't know what you mean.\n  A plant with 3 different names in 3 regions → 3 times the effort, no coordination."
    },
    {
      "id": "01-EARLY-NATURALISTS.md#005",
      "path": [
        "01-EARLY-NATURALISTS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
