        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Early Naturalists - Aristotle, Linnaeus, Buffon, John Ray",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SOLUTION REQUIRED:\n  Universal names → Linnaeus (Latin binomial)\n  Principle of classification → hierarchical (species → genus → family → ... → kingdom)\n  Criteria for classification → morphological (Linnaeus), then evolutionary (Darwin)"
    },
